# This directory holds SSL certificates used by nginx for HTTPS (Tailscale traffic).
#
# Files expected here:
#   tailscale.crt  - Tailscale-provisioned TLS certificate (or self-signed placeholder)
#   tailscale.key  - Corresponding private key
#
# Run scripts/setup-tailscale-certs.sh to provision certificates.
# See docs/TAILSCALE_SETUP.md for full instructions.
#
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT commit real certificate or key files to version control.
